        work("H0-62-W3", "Family-conditioned early-ruler grid", "Family-conditioned early-ruler grid", "단일 139 Mpc target 대신 132.8~136.1 Mpc envelope 전체를 시험한다.", "Test the full 132.8-136.1 Mpc envelope rather than one 139 Mpc target.", "Early energy·extra radiation·recombination 후보의 full spectra와 BBN·growth를 계산한다.", "Calculate full spectra, BBN, and growth for early-energy, extra-radiation, and recombination candidates.", "모형×family×held observable 기각행렬", "Model-by-family-by-held-observable rejection matrix", "한 family만 맞거나 held 관측 하나가 stop rule을 넘으면 기각한다.", "Reject a model that fits only one family or crosses one held-observable stop rule.")
