        { code: "U62-H4", category: pair("수치", "Numerical"), source: pair("Markov multiplicity와 local-H0 Monte Carlo가 moments에 영향을 준다.", "Markov multiplicities and local-H0 Monte Carlo affect moments."), control: pair("Node weighted moments와 analytic reciprocal-normal 적분으로 교차한다.", "Cross-check with Node weighted moments and analytic reciprocal-normal integration."), threshold: pair("Posterior moment 10⁻⁶ 또는 bridge 0.03 Mpc를 넘으면 배포하지 않는다.", "Do not publish if posterior moments differ by 1e-6 or the bridge by 0.03 Mpc.") }
